OL,3,GNEWSASchool plagued by leaks could be
OL,4,Ademolished just 10 years after opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school that opened just 10
OL,7,Fyears ago and has been plagued with
OL,8,Fsevere roof problems could be
OL,9,Fdemolished.
OL,11,FTenby VC School, an English-medium
OL,12,Fprimary for pupils aged three to 11,
OL,13,Fwas built in 2016 but reports of water
OL,14,Fleaking into the building emerged a few
OL,15,Fyears later.
OL,17,FA report ahead of Pembrokeshire
OL,18,Fcouncil's cabinet meeting on 30
OL,19,FNovember recommends moving the school
OL,20,Fpermanently to nearby Ysgol Greenhill.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
