OL,3,GNEWSASchool plagued by leaks could be
OL,4,Ademolished just 10 years after opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the plan, Tenby VC pupils would
OL,7,Fmove into Ysgol Greenhill's existing
OL,8,Ftwo-storey maths block, and the Tenby
OL,9,Fbuilding would be demolished.
